    {
      "flavor_text": "つばさと　あしの　きんにくが　つよく\nちいさな　ポケモンを　つかんだまま\nらくらくと　とぶことが　できる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날개와 발의 근육이 강해\n작은 포켓몬을 붙잡은 채로\n너끈히 날 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses ailes et ses pattes ont des muscles développés.\nIl peut voler en agrippant un petit Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Muskeln in seinen Flügeln und Beinen sind stark.\nEs kann im Flug sogar ein anderes Pokémon tragen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus alas y sus patas son muy fuertes. Puede llevarse\nvolando Pokémon pequeños.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I muscoli di ali e zampe sono molto sviluppati. Vola\nsenza fatica anche portando un piccolo Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The muscles in its wings and legs are strong.\nIt can easily fly while gripping a small Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "翼と　脚の　筋肉が　強く\n小さな　ポケモンを　つかんだまま\nらくらくと　飛ぶことが　できる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus alas y sus patas son muy fuertes. Puede llevarse\nvolando Pokémon pequeños.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ムクホークに　なると　むれから\nはなれて　１ぴきで　いきていく。\nきょうじんな　つばさを　もっている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "찌르호크가 되면 무리에서\n떨어져 혼자서 살아간다.\n강인한 날개를 가지고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsque Étourvol évolue en Étouraptor, il quitte\nson groupe pour vivre seul. Ses ailes sont très\ndéveloppées.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird Staravia zu Staraptor, verlässt es die Gruppe\nund lebt allein. Seine Spannweite ist gigantisch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al evolucionar a Staraptor deja su bandada y pasa a\nvivir en soledad. Sus alas son inmensas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Per diventare Staraptor, lascia il gruppo e affronta\nla vita da solo. Possiede ali robustissime.",
